# Lab Book — Monday 20 July 2026

## Project
Receptor-informed dynamic causal modelling of mismatch negativity using a five-source canonical microcircuit model in SPM26.

## Objectives
1. Reconstruct a five-source, 10-parameter receptor-informed intrinsic-connectivity prior matrix from Ulrich's iEEG DCM collection.
2. Apply the reconstructed priors to the five-source MEG DCM while preserving the remaining standard prior fields.
3. Audit the modified Ulrich inversion pathway before inversion.
4. Invert the receptor-informed model deterministically, with no random EM starts.
5. Build and invert a matched neutral 10-G baseline and compare model evidence.

## Work completed

### 1. Reconstructed the receptor-informed prior matrix
